LOCUS       pH2rU3_d1GTSS_ex       10873 bp    DNA     circular SYN 22-DEC-2025
DEFINITION  Forward inducible lentivirus with mCherry.  It has zsGreen that is 
            linked to Puropycin resistance gene by T2A linker.
ACCESSION   .
VERSION     .
KEYWORDS    .
